    {
      "id": "claim_200e0fc9f18b44bd93d5b2966aed6492",
      "statement": "The graph integration treats `store`, `policy_docs`, and `tools` as runtime-only collaborators carried by `AgentContext`, not checkpointed state, because those objects can include live boto3 and MCP client objects that are not msgpack-serializable.",
