    {
      "id": "claim_3878f121948941eda38d30e1be416eb8",
      "statement": "The response from `invoke` returns `application_id` plus stable S3 URIs for `policy_check`, `companies_house`, and `web_search` results under the identity-derived `s3://<bucket>/<customer_id>/<application_id>` prefix, while the graph also writes other artifacts such as `financial_assessment/result.json` and `decision/result.json` to the same prefix.",
